
[TestNoAsyncGlobalFunctions/invalid-0 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: asyncGlobalFunction (1:1 - 1:10)
Message: `setTimeout` is handed a callback, so calling it directly leaves work nothing owns.
Help: Wrap it in a class that owns the pending work, so disposing the class disposes the work.
   1 | setTimeout(() => {}, 1000);
     | ~~~~~~~~~~
